 large container during the opening ceremony of the 2014 Seoul Kimchi Making &amp; Sharing Festival on November 14.\n</p><p>November 14, 2014\n</p><p>Seoul Plaza, Seoul  \n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading1\"><h1 id=\"Related_Article\">Related Article</h1></div>\n<p>-Cheong Wa Dae-\nThousands of people make kimchi with hands, heart\n&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://english1.president.go.kr/korea/korea.php?srh\">http://english1.president.go.kr/korea/korea.php?srh</a>[board_no]=29&amp;srh[page]=7&amp;srh[view_mode]=detail&amp;srh[seq]=8486&amp;srh[detail_no]=1067\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;english1.president.go.kr/korea/korea.php?srh%5Bboard_no%5...&lt;/a&gt;\n</p><p>-Korea.net-\n-English-\nThousands of people make kimchi with hands, heart\n&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://www.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122983\">http://www.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122983</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;www.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122983&lt;/a&gt;\n</p><p>-espa\u00f1ol-\nMiles de personas se reunieron para preparan kimchi con las manos y el coraz\u00f3n \n&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://spanish.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122985#sthash.0MlizEx9.dpuf\">http://spanish.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122985#sthash.0MlizEx9.dpuf</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;spanish.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122985...&lt;/a&gt;\n</p><p>-\u4e2d\u6587-\n\u8d8a\u51ac\u6ce1\u83dc\uff0c\u4f20\u9012\u5fc3\u610f\u7684\u5236\u4f5c\n&lt;a href=\"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://chinese.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122970#sthash.9CNQorqj.dpuf\">http://chinese.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122970#sthash.9CNQorqj.dpuf</a>\" rel=\"nofollow\"&gt;chinese.korea.net/NewsFocus/Culture/view?articleId=122970...&lt;/a&gt;\n</p><p>-Vi\u1ec7t-\nMu\u1ed1i Kimchi, g\u1eedi g\u1eaf